"rule":{"type":"visited","page":"new-repository"}}]},{"key":"create-repo","title":"Create the private repository","instruction":"Set **Owner** to **contoso-labs**, **Repository name** to `inventory-api-docs`, add **Description**, choose **Private**, enable **Add a README file**, choose **Node** for **Add .gitignore**, choose **MIT License**, and select **Create repository**.","explanation":"Visibility and starter files define the initial repository state.","targetId":"create-repo-form","rules":[{"key":"repo-created","description":"Private repository exists","rule":{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories","match":{"fullName":"contoso-labs/inventory-api-docs","visibility":"private"}}},{"key":"files-created","description":"Starter files exist","rule":{"type":"allOf","rules":[{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories.1.files","match":{"path":"README.md"}},{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories.1.files","match":{"path":".gitignore"}},{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories.1.files","match":{"path":"LICENSE"}}]}}]},{"key":"branch-edit","title":"Create a branch and commit README.md","instruction":"Use the branch selector to create **docs/update-readme** from **main**. Open **README.md**, select **Edit file**, add the review workflow text, choose **Commit directly to the docs/update-readme branch**, and select **Commit changes...**.","explanation":"A branch keeps review work separate from main.","targetId":"branch-selector","rules":[{"key":"branch-exists","description":"Branch was created","rule":{"type":"anyOf","rules":[{"type":"includes","path":"repositories.1.branches","value":"docs/update-readme"},{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories","match":{"fullName":"contoso-labs/inventory-api-docs","branchDeleted":true}}]}},{"key":"readme-updated","description":"README mentions pull requests","rule":{"type":"matches","path":"repositories.1.readme","pattern":"pull requests"}}]},{"key":"open-pr","title":"Open the pull request","instruction":"Select **Compare & pull request**, complete the pull request, add reviewer **maya**, and select **Create Pull Request**.","explanation":"A pull request compares the branch to main.","targetId":"compare-pr-banner","rules":[{"key":"pr-open","description":"PR was opened","rule":{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories.1.pullRequests","match":{"head":"docs/update-readme","base":"main"}}}]},{"key":"review-merge","title":"Review and merge","instruction":"Open **Files changed**, return to **Conversation**, select **Simulate teammate approval**, select **Merge pull request**, choose a method, and select **Confirm merge**.","explanation":"Files changed shows the exact diff; merge methods control history.","targetId":"approve-pr","rules":[{"key":"files-viewed","description":"Files changed opened","rule":{"type":"visited","page":"pr-files"}},{"key":"merged","description":"PR merged","rule":{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories.1.pullRequests","match":{"merged":true,"approved":true}}}]},{"key":"delete-branch","title":"Delete the branch","instruction":"Select **Delete branch**.","explanation":"A merged topic branch can be deleted.","targetId":"delete-branch-button","rules":[{"key":"branch-deleted","description":"Branch deleted","rule":{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories","match":{"fullName":"contoso-labs/inventory-api-docs","branchDeleted":true}}}]}],"finalRules":[{"key":"private-final","description":"Repository is private","rule":{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories","match":{"fullName":"contoso-labs/inventory-api-docs","visibility":"private"}}},{"key":"merged-final","description":"main contains the change","rule":{"type":"arrayContains","path":"repositories","match":{"fullName":"contoso-labs/inventory-api-docs","mainContainsChange":true}}},{"key":"branch-deleted-final","description":"Branch deleted","rule":{"type":"not","rule":{"type":"includes","path":"repositories.1.branches","value":"docs/update-readme"}}}],"solution":"1. Select **New repository**.\n2. Set **Owner** to **contoso-labs**, name `inventory-api-docs`, choose **Private**, enable **Add a README file**, set **Add .gitignore** to **Node**, set **Choose a license** to **MIT License**, and select **Create repository**.\n3. Create **docs/update-readme** from **main**.\n4. Open **README.md**, select **Edit file**, add the review workflow text, choose **Commit directly to the docs/update-readme branch**, and select **Commit changes...**.\n5. Select **Compare & pull request**, complete the PR, and select **Create Pull Request**.\n6. Open **Files changed**, return to **Conversation**, approve, select **Merge pull request**, choose a merge method, and select **Confirm merge**.\n7. Select **Delete branch**."}]}


